  "body": "### What problem are you trying to solve?\n\nGoogle and other browsers autocapitalize texts, but this automation process become a problem when the input text requires a case sensitive input text.\n\n### What solutions exist today?\n\nI think there is a \"pattern\" attribute to avoid it.\n\n### How would you solve it?\n\nWith a new attribute \"autocapitalize\" set to \"on\"/\"off\"|\"true\"/\"false\" could be better than existent solutions.\n\n### Anything else?\n\nNo, thanks.",
